  "name": "Knight of Xoroth: Demonic Rage grants Rage per Demon's Blood generated, also at the cap (#12430)",
  "contract": [
    "Demonic Rage 524922 reads 'Generating Demon's Blood stacks now generates $/10;s1 additional Rage' (s1 = 10, so 1",
    "Rage). Demon's Blood is 800999; Demonfire 500906 is a different resource (both DBCs). Bloodied Blade 800997",
    "('Melee Physical damage dealt now generates a stack of Demon's Blood', spell_proc chance 100) casts 800999 on",
    "every melee physical hit, including at the 10-stack cap. #12430 reports no Demonic Rage at the cap: the grant was",
    "wired to Demonfire gains instead. Brimstone Bludgeon 520005 hits the target and every enemy within 8 yd and",
    "generates 1 Demonfire, so with three packed enemies each cast gives three Demon's Blood generations and one",
    "Demonfire gain. The control cast without the talent logs no 524922 energize. With the talent and Demon's Blood",
    "capped, five casts give at least 15 generations, so at least 15 energizes of 10 internal Rage each; the old",
    "Demonfire wiring logs only one per cast (5)."
  ],
